OL,3,GNEWSAWicker Man director's sons
OL,4,Acomplete their late father's film
OL,5,Atrilogy
OL,6,
OL,7,FRobin Hardy always envisaged his iconic
OL,8,F1973 folk horror film The Wicker Man as
OL,9,Fthe first part of a trilogy.
OL,11,FThe Wicker Tree, released in 2011,
OL,12,Fbrought him closer to that ambition,
OL,13,Fbut his death in 2016 at the age of 86
OL,14,Fleft the project incomplete.
OL,16,FNow his sons, Justin and Dominic, have
OL,17,Fbeen able to complete their father's
OL,18,Ftrilogy, after finding a script for the
OL,19,Ffinal film.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
